    2,141-4,280 / 4,281-8,560 and on to 341,601-401,700 - the Rifts Juicer''s
    own table, reprinted under a European name. Read off a 190 dpi render of
    printed 224 rather than the OCR, which welds that page''s five columns.
    Nothing is stored from it: a Rifts O.C.C. carries no `xp_table` here.
  - SO THIS ROW WILL DRIFT FROM THE JUICER AND NOTHING WILL SAY SO. A
    correction to the Juicer - an edition update, a bonus fix, a renamed gear
